type: software
title: "Organon"
abstract: >-
  Instruments for making a body of work internally legible: Daniel's Ontology,
  a dependency-ordered binding vocabulary with stable identifiers; editorial
  grammars for carrying difficult ideas; and formal artifacts that test where
  apparently compatible definitions collapse.
